WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Meet Python three point thirteen.

00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.300
It packs many new features and optimizations over Python three point twelve.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:11.700
It brings a new interactive interpreter, with multi-line editing and color.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:13.300
Tracebacks are colorized too.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.700
Try the experimental free-threaded build, which lets threads run more concurrently,

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.300
or the preliminary JIT.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.700
Read what's new in its guide.

00:00:21.700 --> 00:00:23.700
Get the installers for Windows,

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:26.900
macOS, and source code at python dot org.
